WEBVTT

01:30.440 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:37.480 --> 01:38.720
Come back with me,

01:38.800 --> 01:40.760
and you can live like an ordinary person.

01:41.360 --> 01:42.320
How about that?

01:48.360 --> 01:50.400
But if the Snow City loses a key criminal,

01:51.920 --> 01:53.440
how will I explain it?

01:55.240 --> 01:56.280
If you stay,

01:56.800 --> 01:57.920
you'll die.

01:58.960 --> 02:00.160
Even if it means death,

02:01.200 --> 02:02.480
will you protect him?

02:10.520 --> 02:12.120
I chose this path for myself.

02:13.560 --> 02:14.680
Once chosen…

02:18.200 --> 02:19.400
I won't change it.

02:27.240 --> 02:29.080
Is this what love in this world means?

02:31.360 --> 02:33.080
The strong become weak because of it,

02:33.760 --> 02:34.760
and the wise

02:35.560 --> 02:37.080
become foolish.

02:46.280 --> 02:47.360
Mr. Nan,

02:48.600 --> 02:50.040
if you truly want to help me,

02:52.120 --> 02:53.480
please entrust Bao

02:53.560 --> 02:54.840
to Fu Lansheng.

02:55.880 --> 02:58.880
Ask him to take her
to the Jade Sky Palace to find her father.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.640
If they can't find him,

03:04.640 --> 03:06.080
then send Bao home.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.160
Can you do that?

03:11.520 --> 03:12.520
Alright.

03:47.160 --> 03:48.800
-Let me go!
-Bao!

03:48.880 --> 03:50.480
I want to find Xuanling!

03:50.560 --> 03:51.800
-I want to find Xuanling!
-Bao!

03:52.400 --> 03:53.960
-I want to go out!
-Bao, behave!

03:54.040 --> 03:54.880
Come with me, okay?

03:54.960 --> 03:56.320
I'll take you to find your father.

03:56.400 --> 03:58.240
The Jade Sky Palace has lots of treasures,

03:58.320 --> 03:59.320
filled with treasure energy.

03:59.400 --> 04:00.360
You can have anything you want.

04:00.440 --> 04:02.640
-Okay?
-I don't want you!

04:02.720 --> 04:05.240
I'll give all my treasures to you.
How about that?

04:05.320 --> 04:08.160
Please help me save Xuanling…

04:12.600 --> 04:14.960
Bao, come on.

04:16.120 --> 04:17.360
Listen to me.

04:17.920 --> 04:20.160
This is Xuanling's only request.

04:20.760 --> 04:22.240
Go with Mr. Fu.

04:22.320 --> 04:23.960
Only then can Xuanling be at peace.

04:24.640 --> 04:26.360
And quickly find your father,

04:26.960 --> 04:28.560
so your mother can also rest easy.

04:29.360 --> 04:31.360
Even our Bao

04:31.880 --> 04:33.720
has your own tasks to do,

04:33.800 --> 04:35.920
your own responsibilities, right?

04:36.000 --> 04:40.080
But, Mr. Nan, Xuanling is innocent.

04:40.880 --> 04:42.560
You don't want her to die either, do you?

04:42.640 --> 04:45.800
Let's figure out a way to save her.

04:54.320 --> 04:57.960
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

05:38.880 --> 05:40.560
Sir, are you alright?

05:41.600 --> 05:42.680
Come in.

05:52.760 --> 05:55.680
Sir, has your injury started to heal?

05:57.000 --> 05:58.240
Recovery will still take some time,

05:59.160 --> 06:00.440
but it's no longer serious.

06:00.520 --> 06:02.000
How's Elder Cang doing?

06:02.520 --> 06:04.720
After the battle at the Pearl Tower,
Saint Fajian perished,

06:05.320 --> 06:06.840
and many from
the Immortal Alliance were injured.

06:06.920 --> 06:09.520
Elder Cang is handling the aftermath.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.120
It may take a while longer.

06:17.800 --> 06:18.680
Did you come to me

06:20.000 --> 06:21.360
for something specific?

06:23.840 --> 06:24.880
The sect leaders of the Alliance

06:25.520 --> 06:27.040
are requesting to see you
in the Hall of Integrity.

06:33.360 --> 06:34.400
Alright.

06:35.600 --> 06:36.600
Senior!

06:44.120 --> 06:45.280
Just say what's on your mind.

06:47.160 --> 06:49.240
I overheard a conversation
among the sect leaders.

06:49.320 --> 06:51.080
It seems they have some criticism of you.

06:51.160 --> 06:52.840
They said…

06:57.600 --> 06:58.760
Senior, it's best…

07:00.320 --> 07:01.680
if you hear it for yourself.

07:05.560 --> 07:06.920
Mr. Xie,

07:07.000 --> 07:08.200
the matter of the Dark Abyss Saintess

07:08.280 --> 07:09.400
cannot be delayed any longer.

07:09.480 --> 07:10.640
Indeed.

07:10.720 --> 07:12.400
Even other sects

07:12.480 --> 07:13.840
are aware of Mr. Xie's

07:13.920 --> 07:15.960
close ties with the Dark Abyss Saintess.

07:16.040 --> 07:18.040
-We're concerned…
-Since it's come to this,

07:18.120 --> 07:19.800
there's no need to hide anything.

07:19.880 --> 07:21.560
As the Lord of the Snow City,

07:21.640 --> 07:23.120
you've ignored
the rules of the Immortal Alliance,

07:23.200 --> 07:24.360
bringing disaster upon us.

07:24.440 --> 07:26.480
Shouldn't you provide
an explanation for this?

07:26.560 --> 07:27.680
Mr. Xie.

07:31.200 --> 07:32.840
-Mr. Xie.
-Master He.

07:35.440 --> 07:37.440
You saw how they behaved

07:37.520 --> 07:38.440
just now.

07:39.240 --> 07:40.280
These people,

07:40.960 --> 07:42.720
after receiving your life-saving help,

07:42.800 --> 07:44.840
turned around and pressured you.

07:44.920 --> 07:46.200
It's absolutely unreasonable.

07:47.280 --> 07:48.440
Such is human nature.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.440
When positions are at odds,

07:51.280 --> 07:52.240
gratitude becomes meaningless.

07:55.760 --> 07:58.560
To err is human.

08:00.520 --> 08:01.720
I've known your father

08:01.800 --> 08:03.440
for many years as an old friend.

08:03.520 --> 08:05.880
I won't stand with them to criticize you.

08:06.400 --> 08:07.560
However,

08:07.640 --> 08:09.920
the Immortal Alliance
has suffered repeated blows.

08:10.760 --> 08:12.120
First, your father was attacked,

08:13.240 --> 08:14.440
then the new Alliance Leader

08:14.520 --> 08:16.640
was killed due to the Dark Clan.

08:17.320 --> 08:19.680
The Pearl Tower was also damaged.

08:19.760 --> 08:22.120
The entire Immortal Alliance is in chaos,

08:22.880 --> 08:24.040
desperately in need of a new leader

08:25.160 --> 08:26.840
to stabilize the alliance.

08:28.200 --> 08:29.680
Your suggestion is excellent.

08:30.520 --> 08:31.880
Who do you have in mind?

08:34.760 --> 08:37.080
I want to recommend you

08:37.159 --> 08:39.320
to become the new Alliance Leader.

08:41.159 --> 08:43.520
Don't refuse just yet. Hear me out.

08:44.720 --> 08:45.840
Here's what I think.

08:46.440 --> 08:47.560
First,

08:48.160 --> 08:49.360
your spiritual power has recovered,

08:50.040 --> 08:52.640
and your skill as the greatest
sword cultivator is unmatched.

08:52.720 --> 08:53.920
Second,

08:54.520 --> 08:55.600
in this crisis,

08:56.280 --> 08:57.840
you risked your own safety

08:57.920 --> 09:01.200
and single-handedly saved
half of the Snow City.

09:02.240 --> 09:03.640
If you're willing

09:03.720 --> 09:05.560
to lead the Immortal Alliance,

09:06.160 --> 09:07.120
you'll surely gain everyone's support.

09:08.720 --> 09:12.480
However, there's only one concern
that weighs on everyone…

09:13.320 --> 09:14.520
Your possession

09:15.320 --> 09:16.440
by the Dark Clan a decade ago

09:17.440 --> 09:20.360
and your current involvement
with the Dark Abyss Saintess.

09:21.040 --> 09:22.040
Therefore,

09:22.720 --> 09:25.320
before becoming the Alliance Leader,

09:25.400 --> 09:28.880
you must execute the Dark Abyss Saintess,

09:30.080 --> 09:32.960
completely sever ties with the Dark Clan,

09:33.040 --> 09:35.360
restore your reputation,

09:35.440 --> 09:38.000
and establish
your authority within the alliance.

10:02.120 --> 10:05.080
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

10:18.400 --> 10:19.560
Xie Xuechen,

10:20.320 --> 10:22.200
what are you doing now?

10:23.320 --> 10:26.440
I borrowed paper cranes
and ink from Nan Xuyue.

10:27.480 --> 10:28.520
There's nothing else,

10:29.120 --> 10:30.520
just to remind you

10:31.080 --> 10:32.040
it's time to kill me.

10:51.720 --> 10:54.040
An evil person with a moment of kindness

10:54.120 --> 10:55.760
is still an evil person at their core.

10:56.560 --> 10:58.360
Such a simple truth,

10:59.080 --> 11:01.040
how could you fail to understand it?

11:26.280 --> 11:27.920
Don't burden yourself.

11:29.040 --> 11:30.400
After you execute me,

11:30.480 --> 11:32.920
just prepare some nice food
for my memorial day,

11:33.520 --> 11:34.960
and I won't hold it against you.

12:44.000 --> 12:47.120
HALL OF SAINTS

13:05.440 --> 13:06.560
Qiumin.

13:07.720 --> 13:08.760
Madam!

13:09.800 --> 13:11.360
Why are you outside my room
so late at night?

13:12.920 --> 13:13.840
Well,

13:13.920 --> 13:15.440
people from the Snow City came by.

13:15.520 --> 13:17.960
They said you're needed
at the Hall of Integrity tomorrow…

13:19.480 --> 13:21.360
to deal with Mu Xuanling.

13:25.920 --> 13:28.040
Do you sympathize with that witch

13:28.720 --> 13:30.640
and plan to plead for her?

13:33.320 --> 13:35.240
How many times
will you repeat the same mistake?

13:36.480 --> 13:39.040
When did you become so soft and timid,

13:39.640 --> 13:41.600
sympathizing with
the Spirit Clan and the Dark Clan?

13:45.000 --> 13:45.840
Madam,

13:46.640 --> 13:48.640
she did save our Mirage Palace once.

13:49.240 --> 13:50.840
And back when Sang Qi attacked the manor,

13:51.360 --> 13:52.560
she sacrificed herself for me.

13:53.080 --> 13:54.520
I owe her a debt of gratitude.

13:55.280 --> 13:56.360
So, could you

13:56.960 --> 13:58.640
plead for her tomorrow?

13:58.720 --> 14:00.400
Madam, I'm begging you.

14:01.360 --> 14:02.400
Madam…

14:05.840 --> 14:08.000
You have your mother's kind heart,

14:08.600 --> 14:09.840
but Qiumin,

14:09.920 --> 14:12.880
some people and some things
are not worth your concern.

14:13.480 --> 14:15.320
They should never have existed,

14:15.920 --> 14:17.280
let alone stayed behind.

14:18.920 --> 14:22.360
HALL OF SAINTS

14:22.440 --> 14:23.760
Besides,

14:23.840 --> 14:26.920
if Xie Xuechen,
as the Lord of the Snow City,

14:27.520 --> 14:30.000
wants to correct his mistakes
and resolve the disputes,

14:30.600 --> 14:33.120
he must personally execute that witch.

14:34.320 --> 14:36.160
Otherwise, the name of the Snow City

14:37.480 --> 14:38.720
will be tarnished.

14:58.840 --> 15:00.080
Kill me.

15:01.240 --> 15:04.480
Use my life
to prove your unwavering faith,

15:05.720 --> 15:07.960
to silence the accusations
of colluding with the Dark Clan.

15:09.080 --> 15:11.400
Mr. Xie,
before becoming the Alliance Leader,

15:11.480 --> 15:15.480
you must first execute
the Dark Abyss Saintess,

15:15.560 --> 15:18.240
completely sever ties with the Dark Clan.

15:22.560 --> 15:23.760
Kill me,

15:24.760 --> 15:26.280
and you'll once again

15:27.560 --> 15:29.320
be the symbol of justice,

15:30.000 --> 15:31.320
the beacon of righteousness.

15:37.000 --> 15:38.480
Mu Xuanling, it's time to go.

15:40.360 --> 15:41.840
He's finally made up his mind.

15:43.080 --> 15:45.640
Taking advice always brings benefits.

15:48.440 --> 15:49.560
Let's go.

16:03.800 --> 16:05.560
Even though Miss Mu
is the Dark Abyss Saintess,

16:06.080 --> 16:07.600
she hasn't done anything evil.

16:08.520 --> 16:09.840
Dealing with her this way

16:10.600 --> 16:11.600
is far too cruel.

16:14.640 --> 16:16.360
Thankfully, I didn't tell Bao.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.800
If she found out,

16:17.880 --> 16:19.120
she'd be heartbroken.

16:21.520 --> 16:22.480
Nan Xuyue,

16:22.560 --> 16:25.200
let's just leave. Watching this execution

16:25.280 --> 16:26.120
is too harsh.

16:26.200 --> 16:27.040
Here they come.

16:34.320 --> 16:36.040
Sir, the person has been brought.

16:49.920 --> 16:51.360
Do you have any last words?

16:55.800 --> 16:56.680
Yes.

16:59.200 --> 17:00.200
Your injury…

17:01.480 --> 17:02.600
Has it healed?

17:08.599 --> 17:09.640
It's fully healed.

17:13.480 --> 17:14.680
Then I'm relieved.

17:16.680 --> 17:17.680
Let's begin.

18:13.760 --> 18:15.400
Mr. Xie, what is the meaning of this?

18:16.200 --> 18:17.880
Why not execute her outright?

18:17.960 --> 18:19.360
I've expelled her demonic power

18:20.360 --> 18:21.960
and will imprison her in Snow City
for the next thousand years.

18:23.160 --> 18:24.280
That is enough.

18:25.000 --> 18:26.400
She is the Dark Abyss Saintess.

18:26.480 --> 18:28.920
That alone is enough
to sentence her to death.

18:29.840 --> 18:32.120
Mr. Xie, this will be hard to justify.

18:32.880 --> 18:36.800
It will especially disappoint
the cultivators of the Xuantian Sect.

18:51.920 --> 18:53.720
Miss Mu was controlled
by demonic energy that day.

18:54.600 --> 18:55.800
After regaining her senses,

18:56.840 --> 18:58.160
she even stopped Ignorance Demon.

18:58.800 --> 18:59.920
Her heart is kind.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.240
The dead are gone.

19:02.320 --> 19:03.800
How she is dealt with

19:05.040 --> 19:06.480
is a decision

19:06.560 --> 19:08.120
for the living to make.

19:11.280 --> 19:13.560
If Mr. Xie won't kill her,

19:13.640 --> 19:15.400
then I will.

19:15.480 --> 19:17.080
Madam!

19:24.840 --> 19:26.520
this is Snow City.

19:30.920 --> 19:32.520
This is my decision.

19:38.480 --> 19:41.520
Mr. Xie, are you openly shielding her?

19:44.240 --> 19:46.000
Protecting the guilty is called shielding.

19:46.600 --> 19:47.720
But Mu Xuanling…

19:49.000 --> 19:49.840
is innocent.

19:50.480 --> 19:51.560
Innocent?

19:52.840 --> 19:54.240
Mr. Xie, what do you mean by this?

19:56.120 --> 19:57.360
Since the Dark Abyss,

19:58.960 --> 20:00.400
Mu Xuanling has assisted me at every turn,

20:01.360 --> 20:02.320
helping the Immortal Alliance,

20:04.080 --> 20:05.400
recovering the jade token,
uncovering traitors,

20:06.000 --> 20:07.120
and eliminating the Three Demons.

20:08.680 --> 20:10.640
She was even willing
to sacrifice her own life.

20:11.840 --> 20:13.040
For someone like her,

20:14.000 --> 20:16.400
if the Immortal Alliance blames her
simply based on her identity

20:17.040 --> 20:18.200
and seeks her death,

20:19.000 --> 20:20.480
it is the Alliance's failing.

20:21.600 --> 20:22.800
I do not agree,

20:23.840 --> 20:24.680
nor will I comply.

20:24.760 --> 20:27.080
Mr. Xie, don't blur the line
between good and evil!

20:27.160 --> 20:29.800
Does the judgment of you
define absolute truth?

20:47.000 --> 20:48.480
I, Xie Xuechen,

20:49.200 --> 20:50.520
live by my own principles

20:51.680 --> 20:52.960
and make my own judgments.

21:12.240 --> 21:14.200
Expelling Mu Xuanling's demonic power

21:15.440 --> 21:16.760
is not a punishment,

21:17.720 --> 21:20.320
but a means to help her
completely leave the Dark Abyss behind.

21:21.200 --> 21:22.760
Imprisoning her for a thousand years

21:24.040 --> 21:25.200
is to settle the past.

21:39.760 --> 21:40.840
From this moment forward,

21:41.880 --> 21:42.920
Mu Xuanling

21:43.800 --> 21:45.560
belongs to the Snow City.

21:58.120 --> 22:00.600
Who would've thought
that Mr. Xie is also a man of compassion?

22:01.200 --> 22:02.760
Miss Mu's survival

22:02.840 --> 22:04.320
is truly a blessing.

22:07.400 --> 22:08.840
Indeed, it's a good thing.

22:19.280 --> 22:20.720
Congratulations, sir,
on mastering the Separation Array.

22:25.480 --> 22:27.360
The world often admires offensive arrays,

22:27.880 --> 22:29.280
but few realize
that the protective arrays,

22:29.360 --> 22:31.080
which ensure survival,
are the hardest to master.

22:32.320 --> 22:34.040
If one cannot become the strongest,

22:34.120 --> 22:35.560
then being able to escape

22:35.640 --> 22:37.600
from powerful enemies with arrays

22:37.680 --> 22:39.240
is a supreme strategy in itself.

22:39.320 --> 22:41.120
Once this array is activated,

22:41.200 --> 22:42.640
it will consume a great deal
of energy from the user.

22:43.320 --> 22:45.360
Unless it's a life-or-death situation,
use it carefully, sir.

22:47.320 --> 22:49.040
Even moments of life or death

22:49.120 --> 22:50.520
are also destined by fate.

22:50.600 --> 22:52.360
So, why bother escaping with an array?

22:53.440 --> 22:55.120
Perhaps this array

22:56.000 --> 22:58.080
will never need to be used.

23:02.560 --> 23:04.400
An array I thought unnecessary to use

23:05.240 --> 23:06.080
was almost activated.

23:07.400 --> 23:09.360
A person I believed lost forever

23:09.440 --> 23:10.840
was finally reunited.

23:12.200 --> 23:13.240
Mu Xuanling,

23:13.880 --> 23:15.160
keeping you alive

23:16.120 --> 23:17.440
is my decision as well.

23:23.960 --> 23:27.160
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

23:33.440 --> 23:34.560
Mu Xuanling,

23:35.600 --> 23:36.600
I'm sorry.

23:38.280 --> 23:39.960
I didn't give you the chance to choose.

24:28.840 --> 24:30.040
I asked her…

24:31.600 --> 24:32.720
whether she'd be willing to follow me

24:32.800 --> 24:34.480
to live in seclusion
at the Greenview Heights.

24:35.840 --> 24:36.920
For your sake,

24:37.800 --> 24:38.960
she refused.

24:39.840 --> 24:41.000
There's another way.

24:42.000 --> 24:43.160
Expelling her demonic power

24:43.880 --> 24:45.320
would prevent it from attacking her.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.640
However, that is highly dangerous.

24:48.640 --> 24:51.040
For a Spirit Clan member
with damaged spiritual channels,

24:51.120 --> 24:53.520
it would eventually lead
to physical collapse

24:53.600 --> 24:54.520
and death.

24:55.120 --> 24:56.720
If she has the protection
of the Jade Vault Technique,

24:57.640 --> 24:58.680
she could survive.

24:59.680 --> 25:01.120
This is another secret.

25:06.080 --> 25:07.320
Ten years ago,

25:08.640 --> 25:09.720
my father found me,

25:09.800 --> 25:11.760
severely injured and near death,
at the Moonlight Heights.

25:12.600 --> 25:13.960
At that time,
my spiritual channels were destroyed.

25:14.840 --> 25:16.280
A human body

25:17.040 --> 25:19.000
requires the opening
of yin and yang channels

25:19.960 --> 25:21.480
to reach peak physical condition.

25:21.560 --> 25:24.000
Only then can the spiritual channels
be opened for cultivation.

25:25.040 --> 25:26.680
If your spiritual channels were destroyed,

25:26.760 --> 25:29.080
how did you reach the pinnacle
of the Spiritual Form stage?

25:29.160 --> 25:30.240
The Xie family

25:30.760 --> 25:32.800
has fought tirelessly
for generations, often suffering injuries.

25:33.640 --> 25:36.000
Thus, we are trained
in healing techniques from a young age.

25:37.560 --> 25:39.720
At the brink of death,
I comprehended the Jade Vault Technique.

25:40.440 --> 25:42.320
Within three days,
my spiritual channels were restored,

25:43.200 --> 25:44.880
and my cultivation not only
remained intact but improved.

25:46.200 --> 25:47.360
The Jade Vault Technique…

25:48.280 --> 25:49.920
has such miraculous effects?

25:52.160 --> 25:53.360
So,

25:54.600 --> 25:55.920
you intend to open her spiritual channels?

25:56.720 --> 25:57.640
Yes.

25:58.640 --> 25:59.720
With spiritual channels,

25:59.800 --> 26:01.560
she will be able
to cultivate spiritual power,

26:01.640 --> 26:03.720
no longer suffering from
demonic energy consuming her body,

26:04.400 --> 26:06.120
nor fearing the burning sun,

26:06.800 --> 26:07.880
or returning to the Dark Abyss.

26:08.800 --> 26:10.240
She can live honorably

26:10.840 --> 26:12.440
in the human realm.

26:18.200 --> 26:20.320
Granting the Spirit Clan
spiritual channels

26:20.400 --> 26:22.280
could change
the balance of the three realms.

26:23.680 --> 26:24.920
But…

26:26.280 --> 26:27.880
What does it matter?

26:29.960 --> 26:30.880
Mu Xuanling,

26:31.440 --> 26:32.520
live well.

26:33.400 --> 26:35.280
Keep being that interesting person

26:36.400 --> 26:37.920
who brings a bit of freshness

26:39.280 --> 26:40.440
to this dull world.

26:40.520 --> 26:41.360
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

26:48.760 --> 26:49.840
Mu Xuanling!

26:51.640 --> 26:54.280
-Mu Xuanling.
-Xie Xuechen, I'm cold.

27:21.840 --> 27:22.840
Mu Xuanling,

27:23.560 --> 27:24.520
hold on.

27:25.600 --> 27:27.000
Endure for three days.

27:28.240 --> 27:29.400
After three days,

27:30.600 --> 27:32.040
I'll take you to see the human realm.

27:32.920 --> 27:34.000
Alright?

28:01.760 --> 28:04.120
I just watched a new batch
of Spirit Clan warriors battling.

28:04.640 --> 28:06.280
They've been fighting for hours

28:06.360 --> 28:07.280
without a winner.

28:08.160 --> 28:10.040
What a disappointing group.

28:11.240 --> 28:12.080
If you ask me,

28:12.160 --> 28:13.440
in terms of ruthlessness and decisiveness,

28:13.520 --> 28:15.160
they're far inferior to the Saintess
back in the day. Am I right?

28:21.200 --> 28:22.080
What are you doing?

28:22.600 --> 28:24.760
You want to fight too, huh? Come on!

28:25.960 --> 28:28.480
Shut up already.
How dare you mention the Saintess!

28:29.440 --> 28:31.680
His Grace has been
in a bad mood these days

28:31.760 --> 28:32.840
because the Saintess

28:32.920 --> 28:34.760
would rather die
than return to the Dark Abyss.

28:34.840 --> 28:37.160
And you dare bring her up?
Are you asking to die?

28:41.040 --> 28:42.520
Ignorance Demon, you're back.

28:44.480 --> 28:45.680
Ignorance Demon,

28:45.760 --> 28:46.840
you're impressive!

28:47.360 --> 28:48.200
On this trip,

28:48.800 --> 28:49.640
you destroyed

28:49.720 --> 28:51.240
Fajian's 500-year-old golden core.

28:51.320 --> 28:53.280
Look at that self-destructive resolve.

28:54.720 --> 28:55.720
I truly admire it!

29:01.320 --> 29:02.880
In just a few days,

29:04.160 --> 29:07.200
my cultivation has reached such heights?

29:09.400 --> 29:10.240
Ignorance Demon,

29:10.320 --> 29:12.400
you self-destructed your golden core,
even injuring your true form.

29:12.480 --> 29:14.840
What a lose-lose situation.

29:14.920 --> 29:16.280
You're truly remarkable.

29:17.480 --> 29:19.920
Sooner or later, I'll kill Xie Xuechen.

29:20.000 --> 29:21.960
Enough with the big talk,

29:22.040 --> 29:23.280
okay?

29:23.360 --> 29:24.920
Go soak in the Void Sea.

29:25.000 --> 29:26.200
You know,

29:26.880 --> 29:28.760
I don't like companions who are too weak.

29:32.200 --> 29:34.280
I just came out of the Void Sea,

29:35.600 --> 29:37.240
and something feels odd.

29:37.840 --> 29:40.120
Today, the demonic energy
in the Void Sea is surging,

29:40.960 --> 29:42.400
as if

29:44.040 --> 29:46.200
something unusual is about to emerge.

30:07.480 --> 30:09.360
How much longer do we need to stay here?

30:09.960 --> 30:12.320
I can't get used to this icy, snowy place.

30:14.400 --> 30:16.400
Ignorance Demon self-destructed
Saint Fajian's golden core.

30:16.480 --> 30:18.440
The Pearl Tower now has cracks,

30:18.520 --> 30:19.840
weakening its defenses.

30:19.920 --> 30:21.480
All sects need to guard the Chaos Pearl.

30:22.080 --> 30:24.000
At a time like this, how can we leave?

30:24.640 --> 30:26.800
The Snow City has already sent
half its disciples to guard the tower.

30:27.880 --> 30:30.280
So, how long will it take
to repair the Pearl Tower?

30:31.440 --> 30:34.320
Although the artifact will heal itself,

30:34.400 --> 30:36.280
it will still take more than ten days.

30:36.360 --> 30:37.560
That long?

30:37.640 --> 30:38.840
Isn't Mr. Xie trying
to come up with a solution?

30:38.920 --> 30:40.720
Speaking of Mr. Xie,

30:40.800 --> 30:41.920
I heard

30:42.000 --> 30:43.640
he brought Mu Xuanling back to his room

30:43.720 --> 30:45.840
and hasn't left for three days and nights.

30:45.920 --> 30:47.440
Could it be

30:47.520 --> 30:50.360
that the Snow City will soon have
a mistress from the Spirit Clan?

30:50.960 --> 30:52.720
The dignified Lord of the Snow City,

30:52.800 --> 30:55.160
completely bewitched by a witch.

30:55.240 --> 30:56.600
If word gets out,

30:56.680 --> 30:58.120
it would be utterly disgraceful.

30:58.200 --> 31:00.880
If anyone's reputation is ruined,
it's the Snow City's.

31:00.960 --> 31:02.680
Even Xie Xuechen hasn't said anything,

31:02.760 --> 31:04.000
so why are you two so concerned?

31:04.080 --> 31:05.240
Miss Gao,

31:05.320 --> 31:07.000
we were just casually chatting.

31:07.080 --> 31:09.200
Besides, it's not just us,

31:09.280 --> 31:10.680
other sects are gossiping too.

31:10.760 --> 31:12.640
If other sects gossip,
does it mean our Mirage Palace

31:12.720 --> 31:13.840
should follow suit?

31:13.920 --> 31:16.840
Miss Gao, Mr. Xie
did harm your father back then.

31:16.920 --> 31:18.560
How can you still defend him?

31:19.680 --> 31:22.040
What do you want me to do?
Should I kill him for revenge?

31:22.120 --> 31:23.400
But he also saved me back then.

31:24.000 --> 31:25.080
About possession by the Dark Clan,

31:25.160 --> 31:26.360
I was also possessed by Anger Demon

31:26.440 --> 31:27.520
back at the Greenview Heights.

31:27.600 --> 31:30.040
If Anger Demon had succeeded that day,
would I have to pay with my life too?

31:30.120 --> 31:31.320
That's…

31:32.360 --> 31:33.840
That's not what I meant.

31:33.920 --> 31:36.800
Regardless, our Mirage Palace
doesn't gossip people behind their backs.

31:36.880 --> 31:38.360
You two seniors should be mindful.

31:38.440 --> 31:40.640
If gossiping fills you up,
why not let me eat this instead?

31:43.000 --> 31:45.080
Even helping your enemy,
no wonder your family was destroyed!

31:48.840 --> 31:52.840
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

32:57.240 --> 32:58.280
You're awake.

32:59.920 --> 33:01.920
For maintaining my life

33:02.000 --> 33:03.320
and handling official duties,

33:03.960 --> 33:05.480
you've stayed awake
for three days and nights.

33:06.280 --> 33:07.320
Aren't you afraid
of exhausting yourself to death?

33:08.640 --> 33:10.040
Your body hasn't fully recovered.

33:10.760 --> 33:11.880
You should rest more.

33:23.800 --> 33:25.760
The sunlight today is beautiful.

33:26.360 --> 33:29.160
I thought I was destined to die.

33:36.840 --> 33:38.160
My demonic power is gone,

33:39.240 --> 33:40.760
so why am I still alive?

33:43.480 --> 33:44.360
How did you do it?

33:49.680 --> 33:51.360
It's simply fate sparing your life.

33:59.200 --> 34:00.520
You don't want to tell me?

34:02.840 --> 34:04.280
You won't say, but I know…

34:05.320 --> 34:06.640
it must not have been simple.

34:08.880 --> 34:10.520
I think I asked you before.

34:11.120 --> 34:13.239
If I were willing
to give up my demonic power

34:13.320 --> 34:14.679
and become an ordinary person,

34:15.920 --> 34:17.440
would you protect me?

34:19.960 --> 34:21.480
I think I have my answer now.

34:34.719 --> 34:35.560
What should we do?

34:36.520 --> 34:38.760
I've taken on the name of a temptress,

34:38.840 --> 34:40.639
and you've been labeled as favoring me.

34:41.239 --> 34:43.199
But my reputation was already terrible,

34:43.280 --> 34:44.960
so I don't mind it getting worse.

34:46.560 --> 34:47.880
But you've suffered a big loss.

34:48.639 --> 34:50.280
You gained nothing

34:50.360 --> 34:52.000
and even lost your integrity.

34:54.080 --> 34:55.199
Why not

34:56.080 --> 34:57.600
just claim me as yours?

34:58.600 --> 35:00.120
It might make up for some of your losses.

35:02.440 --> 35:03.960
Your body's barely recovered,

35:04.840 --> 35:05.960
and your mouth's already running wild.

35:10.560 --> 35:11.800
And are you any better?

35:13.480 --> 35:15.080
A Spiritual Form cultivator
lives a thousand years,

35:15.160 --> 35:16.960
and the Spirit Clan
also lives a thousand years.

35:18.360 --> 35:20.600
You've sentenced me to be
imprisoned here for a thousand years.

35:21.120 --> 35:22.040
What's on your mind?

35:22.960 --> 35:24.600
Do you plan to protect me
for the rest of your life?

35:26.000 --> 35:26.840
Just a coincidence.

35:29.720 --> 35:31.160
Will you put a Spirit Lock on me?

35:32.360 --> 35:33.360
No.

35:36.720 --> 35:38.520
Will you place restrictions on me?

35:39.200 --> 35:40.440
No.

35:42.000 --> 35:43.640
Then how do you plan to imprison me?

35:47.680 --> 35:48.840
Since you've recovered,

35:50.000 --> 35:51.240
you'll leave the mountain tomorrow.

35:51.320 --> 35:52.440
You want to send me away?

35:55.800 --> 35:57.040
I'll take you to see the human realm.

36:01.680 --> 36:03.480
I still have matters to handle now.

36:04.560 --> 36:05.680
Rest well.

36:17.040 --> 36:18.360
Mu Xuanling,

36:19.200 --> 36:21.920
you'd have moments like this too,
fearing gain and loss?

36:23.320 --> 36:25.080
The strong become weak because of this,

36:25.640 --> 36:27.920
and the wise become foolish.

36:29.440 --> 36:31.440
Nan Xuyue was right.

36:33.880 --> 36:35.320
Love has truly misled me.

36:49.000 --> 36:50.560
Your disciples told me

36:50.640 --> 36:51.720
that after days of meditation,

36:51.800 --> 36:53.240
you're finally willing to explain

36:53.920 --> 36:55.320
why your faith collapsed.

36:57.680 --> 37:00.240
A few years ago, I met someone…

37:00.840 --> 37:01.880
someone

37:02.560 --> 37:04.080
who stirred inner demons within me.

37:05.240 --> 37:06.080
Who?

37:07.200 --> 37:08.800
The Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

37:15.680 --> 37:18.440
Demons can never be fully wiped out.

37:19.080 --> 37:21.040
But have you ever considered

37:21.120 --> 37:22.280
why among all the ways in the world,

37:22.360 --> 37:24.080
only the teachings of your Xuantian Sect

37:24.160 --> 37:26.760
can guide people
to eliminate inner demons?

37:28.160 --> 37:29.960
It shows that great responsibility
has been bestowed

37:31.000 --> 37:32.280
upon the Xuantian Sect.

37:35.800 --> 37:37.760
If everyone joined the Xuantian Sect,

37:37.840 --> 37:39.920
recited the mantras
to reflect their hearts,

37:40.000 --> 37:41.240
returned to their true selves,

37:41.840 --> 37:42.960
freed from selfish desires,

37:43.480 --> 37:45.240
and escaped
the pain of unfulfilled longing,

37:45.760 --> 37:47.000
then the world

37:47.680 --> 37:49.080
would have no love or hate

37:50.000 --> 37:51.920
and naturally, no inner demons.

37:59.840 --> 38:01.040
And you believed him?

38:02.480 --> 38:04.280
I wanted to forget his words,

38:05.640 --> 38:07.040
but for some reason,

38:07.920 --> 38:10.160
the more I tried, the less I could.

38:11.040 --> 38:12.840
As days and nights turned,

38:12.920 --> 38:14.640
as seasons changed,

38:15.760 --> 38:17.440
his words

38:17.520 --> 38:18.880
would occasionally

38:19.440 --> 38:21.240
echo in my ears.

38:22.360 --> 38:23.440
Gradually,

38:24.440 --> 38:25.880
I came to feel that his guidance

38:26.520 --> 38:27.800
was correct.

38:28.520 --> 38:30.880
So, you conspired with the Decaying
Immortal Pavilion and the Dark Clan,

38:30.960 --> 38:32.880
seeking to expand
the Xuantian Sect's influence

38:32.960 --> 38:35.640
and make the world follow your path.

38:35.720 --> 38:37.320
One thought creates a Buddha.

38:38.320 --> 38:39.480
One thought creates a demon.

38:40.160 --> 38:43.080
You want everyone
to follow the way of the Xuantian Sect,

38:43.760 --> 38:45.160
but have you ever asked
if they're willing?

38:46.160 --> 38:49.000
What if they prefer love and hate,
the pain of unfulfilled desires,

38:49.080 --> 38:50.280
and drowning in their passions?

38:50.920 --> 38:53.080
You want them to follow
Xuantian Sect's way,

38:53.760 --> 38:55.320
but for how long could they keep it up?

38:55.880 --> 38:57.240
Wouldn't their hearts grow bitter?

38:58.160 --> 38:59.760
Now, the Xuantian Sect has many disciples.

39:00.360 --> 39:02.040
How many have truly transcended

39:02.720 --> 39:03.560
as you say?

39:04.480 --> 39:06.560
Isn't there another way

39:06.640 --> 39:09.120
to eliminate inner demons?

39:09.720 --> 39:10.960
I once thought

39:12.120 --> 39:13.400
that demons arise from the heart.

39:14.120 --> 39:15.120
They're like shadows.

39:16.120 --> 39:17.520
Shadows exist

39:19.400 --> 39:21.240
because we live in the light.

39:22.160 --> 39:23.520
When the sun is low in the east or west,

39:23.600 --> 39:25.240
shadows grow long.

39:25.320 --> 39:26.920
When the sun is at its peak,
shadows grow short.

39:27.920 --> 39:29.760
The true way to defeat demons

39:29.840 --> 39:32.280
is to create
a flourishing era of peace and prosperity,

39:32.360 --> 39:34.440
where everyone
has a place of comfort and joy.

39:34.520 --> 39:37.200
Inner demons would have no place to dwell.

39:45.800 --> 39:47.280
But how to achieve

39:48.560 --> 39:51.840
such an era is the eternal challenge.

39:55.400 --> 39:56.880
The more I see,

39:58.000 --> 40:00.320
the more I feel humanity has lost its way.

40:01.480 --> 40:02.440
Under the rule of the Immortal Alliance,

40:03.520 --> 40:05.960
human lives have grown
more stable and prosperous.

40:07.040 --> 40:08.480
But in contrast,

40:09.080 --> 40:11.400
the Spirit Clan
has been driven to desolate lands,

40:11.480 --> 40:13.040
enslaved or oppressed,

40:13.640 --> 40:14.480
filled with hatred.

40:16.480 --> 40:18.360
A world where one side dominates

40:18.440 --> 40:20.760
is not a safe place for others.

40:25.040 --> 40:26.600
So, what must be done now

40:27.560 --> 40:29.040
is not to stop killing with more killing,

40:29.120 --> 40:32.160
but to find
a proper balance for coexistence,

40:32.240 --> 40:33.080
embracing harmony in diversity.

40:43.480 --> 40:45.680
Thank you, sir, for clearing my doubts.

40:48.920 --> 40:51.920
I now have three questions
I need answers to.

40:52.520 --> 40:53.760
Please speak, sir.

40:53.840 --> 40:54.920
First,

40:56.560 --> 40:57.600
where is the Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion?

40:58.920 --> 41:00.040
I don't know.

41:02.440 --> 41:03.520
Second,

41:04.800 --> 41:07.040
on the night the sects
of the Alliance arrived at Snow City,

41:07.120 --> 41:08.560
I was attacked.

41:08.640 --> 41:10.080
The attacker wore black robes and a mask,

41:10.880 --> 41:12.280
and his cultivation was above
the Spirit Manifestation level

41:12.360 --> 41:13.240
but below the Spiritual Form stage.

41:13.320 --> 41:14.960
He was likely from
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

41:15.960 --> 41:17.000
Who was he?

41:18.800 --> 41:20.360
The Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion

41:20.440 --> 41:22.800
has a most trusted agent

41:22.880 --> 41:23.920
whose cultivation is above
the Spirit Manifestation level.

41:24.560 --> 41:25.920
But their face

41:26.000 --> 41:28.480
has always been hidden
behind a black veil.

41:29.560 --> 41:31.200
I don't know who he is.

41:31.280 --> 41:32.800
Forgive me. I can't help.

41:35.800 --> 41:36.920
Sir,

41:37.000 --> 41:38.560
please speak of the third question.

41:46.440 --> 41:47.600
As for the third question,

41:49.720 --> 41:50.560
the answer lies with you.

41:58.760 --> 41:59.960
All crises that have befallen

42:00.680 --> 42:02.040
the Immortal Alliance

42:03.760 --> 42:05.240
are entirely my fault.

42:08.320 --> 42:10.480
I am guilty beyond redemption.

42:12.080 --> 42:13.120
Now,

42:13.800 --> 42:15.320
my senior has passed away

42:16.840 --> 42:18.640
and I bear heavy sins.

42:22.000 --> 42:22.880
I ask you

42:23.680 --> 42:25.320
to spare the Xuantian Sect,

42:25.400 --> 42:27.880
considering our thousand years of effort

42:28.400 --> 42:30.880
to resist the Dark Clan.

42:34.720 --> 42:35.720
Alright.
